    "html": "<p class=\"p\">The eclipse hit one spot in the sky, and that spot sits somewhere different in every chart. For one person it lands on the part that’s about work. For the next it’s the part that’s about home, or money, or one particular person. Same window, completely different life.</p>",
    "text": "The eclipse hit one spot in the sky, and that spot sits somewhere different in every chart. For one person it lands on the part that’s about work. For the next it’s the part that’s about home, or money, or one particular person. Same window, completely different life."
