    "html": "<p class=\"p\">It won’t say money lands on a Tuesday or that someone walks through the door. Nobody honest can say that, and the people who do are the ones who sold you August. It tells you when the door is open, which door, and which day to walk through. What’s on the other side is yours.</p>",
    "text": "It won’t say money lands on a Tuesday or that someone walks through the door. Nobody honest can say that, and the people who do are the ones who sold you August. It tells you when the door is open, which door, and which day to walk through. What’s on the other side is yours."
